        "name": "Copan Maya ruins",
        "description": "A major Maya city famed for its carved stelae, hieroglyphic stairway and macaws.",
        "details": "Copan was a Classic-period Maya centre, with plazas, a ball court and the Hieroglyphic Stairway, the longest Maya inscription known. Scarlet macaws fly around the site. The sculpture museum has a full-scale replica of the Rosalila temple. A guide brings the carvings to life.",
