        "description": "A rescue centre for macaws and tropical birds, with nearby hot springs.",
        "details": "Macaw Mountain rehabilitates parrots and toucans in a forest garden near the town of Copan Ruinas. Luna Jaguar hot springs offer a soak in the forested hills. Both are an easy afternoon after the ruins.",
