        "description": "The largest lake in Honduras, with bird-watching, a craft brewery and Pulhapanzak falls.",
        "details": "Lake Yojoa is a highland lake with more than 400 bird species, boat tours and kayaking. The Pulhapanzak waterfall can be walked behind. A lakeside lodge with a brewery is a classic overnight stop between Copan and the coast.",
