        "description": "A Caribbean port city, with boat trips to a marine reserve of coral cays.",
        "details": "La Ceiba is the hub for the north coast and the ferry port for the Bay Islands. Day boats go to the Cayos Cochinos reserve for snorkelling and white-sand cays, and the Garifuna village of Sambo Creek offers music and food.",
